---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig, telHref } from '../../config/site';

const phone = telHref();
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Virginia Beach Plumbing"
  description="Privacy policy for Virginia Beach Plumbing website and service requests."
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose" style="max-width:46rem">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>
        {siteConfig.brandName} (“we”) collects information you voluntarily submit through our contact forms, such as name, phone, email, ZIP code, and message details so we can respond to plumbing service requests.
      </p>
      <p>
        We may collect basic technical data (such as browser type or pages visited) if analytics tools are enabled on this site.
      </p>
      <h2>Phone calls</h2>
      <p>
        If you call {siteConfig.phoneDisplay}, the line may be answered by an AI assistant that identifies itself as such. We collect the same kinds of service-request details as the website forms (name, phone, address, and a description of the plumbing issue) so we can follow up.
      </p>
      <p>
        Call recording and transcription are off unless the operator enables them and provides any required disclosure on the call. We do not secretly record calls.
      </p>
      <h2>How we use information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To respond to calls and service requests</li>
        <li>To route inquiries to the appropriate follow-up contact</li>
        <li>To improve website performance and usability</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Sharing</h2>
      <p>
        Service requests may be shared with the plumbing professionals fulfilling the work. We do not sell personal information as a product.
      </p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy: call <a href={phone}>{siteConfig.phoneDisplay}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
